<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">lake-tonic-of-steady-hand</ansi> (alchemy recipe)

A pale green tonic that smells sharply of lake-mint and willow
bark. A sip and the small tremors of fatigue and fear go quiet —
the world holds still long enough to land a precise cut, thread
a needle, or pick a lock that will not forgive a fumble.

